<odoo>
    <template id="assets_specific" inherit_id="report.assets_common">
        <xpath expr="." position="inside">
            <link rel="stylesheet" href="/specific_account/static/src/css/report_account.css"/>
        </xpath>
    </template>

    <template id="report_deliveryslip_alcyon">
        <div class="page">
            <table id="products_table" class="round_table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Product<br/>reference</th>
                        <th>Name</th>
                        <th>Quantity</th>
                        <th>Lot</th>
                        <th>Expiration<br/>date</th>
                        <th>Unit<br/>price</th>
                        <th>Unit<br/>price<br/>with discount</th>
                        <th>Subtotal<br/>price</th>
                        <th>TVA</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody class="invoice_tbody">
                    <t t-foreach="deliveryslip.get_moves_by_order()" t-as="grouped_lines">
                        <t t-set="order" t-value="grouped_lines[0]"/>
                        <t t-set="move_lines" t-value="grouped_lines[1][0]"/>
                        <t t-set="backorder_move_lines" t-value="grouped_lines[1][1]"/>

                        <t t-if="order">
                            <tr><td/><td/><td/><td/><td/><td/><td/><td/><td/></tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td colspan="9" class="sale_separator">
                                    <div>
                                        <span>Commande</span>
                                        <span t-field="order.name"/>
                                        <span>du</span>
                                        <span t-field="order.date_order_short"/>
                                    </div>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr><td/><td/><td/><td/><td/><td/><td/><td/><td/></tr>
                        </t>

                        <t  t-foreach="move_lines" t-as="line">
                            <t t-set="order_line" t-value="line.order_line_id"/>
                            <t t-set="lot" t-value="line.restrict_lot_id"/>
                            <tr>
                                <td>
                                    <span t-field="line.product_id.default_code"/>
                                </td>
                                <td>
                                    <span t-field="line.product_id.name"/>
                                </td>
                                <td>
                                    <span t-esc="int(line.product_qty)"/>
                                </td>
                                <td>
                                    <span t-if="lot" t-field="lot.name"/>
                                </td>
                                <td>
                                    <span t-if="lot" t-field="lot.life_date"/>
                                </td>
                                <td>
                                    <span t-if="order_line" t-field="order_line.price_unit"
                                          t-field-options='{"widget": "monetary", "display_currency": "order.currency_id"}'/>
                                </td>
                                <td></td>
                                <td>
                                    <span t-if="order_line" t-field="order_line.price_subtotal"
                                          t-field-options='{"widget": "monetary", "display_currency": "order.currency_id"}'/>
                                </td>
                                <td>
                                    <span t-esc="', '.join(map(lambda x: (x.description or x.name), order_line.only_tax_ids))"/>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr t-foreach="order_line.contribution_ids" t-as="contribution">
                                <td></td>
                                <td>
                                    <span t-esc="contribution.description or contribution.name"/>
                                </td>
                                <td>
                                    <span t-esc="int(order_line.qty_delivered)"/>
                                </td>
                                <td></td>
                                <td></td>
                                <td>
                                    <span t-field="contribution.amount"
                                        t-field-options='{"widget": "monetary", "display_currency": "order.currency_id"}'/>
                                </td>
                                <td></td>
                                <td>
                                    <span t-field="order_line.amount_contribution"/>
                                </td>
                                <td></td>
                            </tr>
                        </t>

                        <t t-if="backorder_move_lines">
                            <tr><td/><td/><td/><td/><td/><td/><td/><td/><td/></tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td colspan="9" class="sale_separator">
                                    <div>
                                        <span>Solde à livrer sur la commande </span>
                                        <span t-field="order.name"/>
                                        <table style="width: 50%;">
                                            <tbody>
                                                <tr t-foreach="backorder_move_lines" t-as="line">
                                                    <td style="border: none;">
                                                        <span t-field="line.product_id.default_code"/>
                                                    </td>
                                                    <td style="border: none;">
                                                        <span t-field="line.product_id.name"/>
                                                    </td>
                                                    <td style="border: none;">
                                                        <span t-esc="int(line.product_qty)"/>
                                                    </td>
                                                </tr>
                                            </tbody>
                                        </table>
                                    </div>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr><td/><td/><td/><td/><td/><td/><td/><td/><td/></tr>
                        </t>
                    </t>
                    <tr><td/><td/><td/><td/><td/><td/><td/><td/><td/></tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
            <p>Pour être livré le jour de livraison prévu, veuillez passer vos commandes :<br/>
            <strong>Par Internet</strong> <u>www.alcyonbelux.be</u> : avant <strong>9h15</strong> le jour de livraison.<br/>
            <strong>Par fax ou répondeur</strong> : avant <strong>9h00</strong> le jour de livraison.<br/>
            <strong>Par téléphone</strong> (sauf pour les médicaments): avant <strong>9h00</strong> le jour de livraison</p>
            <p style="font-size: x-small;">Seules seront prises en considération les demandes de retours signalées dans les 48 heures de la réception de la marchandise.<br/>
            Elles devront être faites aurpès de notre <strong>service Qaulité</strong> au <strong>04/338.84.22</strong> ou pas email <strong>qualite@alcyonbelux.be</strong> ou par fax <strong>04/338.84.35</strong></p>

            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-xs-2">
                    <div class="border_table round_table summary_deliverslip">
                        <div style="text-align: center">
                            Number of<br/>packages
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-xs-4">
                    <div class="border_table round_table summary_deliverslip">
                        <div style="height: 50%; border-bottom: 1px solid black">
                            Round:
                        </div>
                        <div style="height: 50%">
                            Delivery:
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-xs-2">
                    <div class="border_table round_table summary_deliverslip" style="text-align: center">
                        <div style="height: 50%; border-bottom: 1px solid black">
                            PORT:
                        </div>
                        <div style="height: 50%">
                            Weight:
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-xs-4">
                    <div class=" border_table round_table summary_deliverslip">
                        <div>
                            Received the:<br/>
                            Signature:
                        </div>

                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

